farmland-atlas/north-dakota/cavalier-county"],["ARC or PLC in Cavalier County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/cavalier-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows February to March came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025 that same pair ran 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, while September to October in 2025 hit 175%. Grid 34329 had its driest year in 1952 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
